Package: tunnelboard
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: TunnelBoard Release Team <release@tunnelboard.local>
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37, policykit-1
Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: Local SSH tunnel and HTTPS route manager
 TunnelBoard manages local SSH forwards and optional local HTTPS routes from a
 graphical desktop session. It does not install a system service.
